0..98 Comment "/// `hello`\'s derivation, as `nix derivation show` prints it, read into a record type and a value."
99..102 Comment "///"
103..282 Comment "/// The Nix type provider reads a derivation into a record type the checker admits. No check-time site performs that read yet, so this source states the provider\'s answer by hand."
283..286 Comment "///"
287..670 Comment "/// `nix/hello.drv.json` is the read\'s JSON for this one derivation, each field of `Derivation` one of its keys. A map whose keys are no labels, as the outputs, the input derivations and the environment are, reads as a list of pairs, each key first. `inputs` reads as two fields, and the environment keeps its 17 variables holding a value, for a value prints at most 32 formers deep."
671..674 Comment "///"
675..691 Comment "/// - see: #2763"
692..708 Comment "/// - see: #2991"
709..725 Comment "/// - see: #2993"
726..742 Comment "/// - see: #3010"
